  - title: Hit
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The first word you're going to learn is the word Hit.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: d4f185bd0a6b1014fb3758f922bdb05a, type: 3}
    - message: Hit means to tap or bump something so it makes a sound.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2a43ce99c63977840a09bb5edcadbfa3, type: 3}
    - message: The word Hit begins with the initial letter H.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8367285dd8aa67a448222a8bdc06f0c9, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by a letter i, t.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d3fce257f4fc8a47bc029bb2c5b3b78, type: 3}
    - message: 'Since H is the initial letter, type it as a capital letter. Remember
        to Capitalize a letter, you have to press dot 6 before the corresponding
        letter. '
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4ced1b82ca3bc974eb09c9774d421ab7, type: 3}
    - message: The word Hit end with the rime -it.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 082a87fcc951980418c1cae40dc62221, type: 3}
    practiceWord: hit
    requireCapitalFirstLetter: 1
    promptMessage: Can you type the word Hit?
    promptAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c22db6ecdc829484aaf356eb0c21af70, type: 3}
    successMessage: That is Correct!
    successAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 90e2580d00d86d440b914433db041fc3, type: 3}
    wrongMessage: Wrong Answer, Please Try Again.
    wrongAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: e4f9a5ae60016d2488f2c66cadae99b1, type: 3}
    supportMessage: Remember, the word is Hit. Begin with a capital H, then type
      i, and t.
    supportAudio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c64b787ee7ac4dd48a5cf240c667dd5e, type: 3}
  - title: Fit
    categoryLabel: LESSON
    lessonImage: {fileID: 0}
    pageType: 1
    informationBeats:
    - message: The next word you're going to learn is the word Fit.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2d7e9311759349445b9dfa8f64b511e9, type: 3}
    - message: Fit means something is just the right size that it feels good on you.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 0f0f4cda738ae3b439dcbf0c372cbaa1, type: 3}
    - message: The word Fit begins with the initial letter F.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ac495e4fa9a7b5d46b33a8709a7a96e5, type: 3}
    - message: Followed up by a letter i, t.
      audio: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4d3fce257f4fc8a47bc029bb2c5b3b78, type: 3}
    - message: 'Since F is the initial letter, type it as a capital letter. Remember
        to Capitalize a letter, you have to press dot 6 before the corresponding
        letter. '
